possibility of forming a Chow with B6-B7-B8 if a missing tile is drawn. Additionally, the player across has already Penged F3, reducing the likelihood they need B8. Playing B8 avoids disrupting potential future melds and maintains hand balance.  \nAnswer: Play B8"}
